  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Traceable Coffee Import</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to be able to scale up Almacena will import 6 containers of coffee beans from Ethiopia, Rwanda and Uganda with the help of DGGF-TA financing. Almacena offers full traceability on the supply chain for their purchased beans and the company focusses on paying increasing the income of the smallholder farmers they purchase from.</narrative>
  </description>
